{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++17 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++17 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nconstexpr int MAXN = 55;\nconstexpr int MAXT = 2 * MAXN;\nconstexpr int MAXP = MAXT * MAXN;\nconstexpr int MAXE = 5 * MAXT * MAXN * MAXN;\nconstexpr int INF = 1000000000;\n\nstruct Edge {\n    int to, cap, cost, nxt;\n};\n\nstruct MinCostMaxFlow {\n    int head[MAXP], ecnt;\n    bool used[MAXP];\n    int dist[MAXP];\n    Edge edges[MAXE];\n    int src, sink, nodeCnt;\n\n    MinCostMaxFlow() : ecnt(1), src(1), sink(2), nodeCnt(2) {\n        memset(head, 0, sizeof(head));\n    }\n\n    inline void addRaw(int a, int b, int cost, int cap) {\n        ++ecnt;\n        edges[ecnt].to = b;\n        edges[ecnt].cap = cap;\n        edges[ecnt].cost = cost;\n        edges[ecnt].nxt = head[a];\n        head[a] = ecnt;\n    }\n\n    inline void addEdge(int a, int b, int cost, int cap) {\n        addRaw(a, b, cost, cap);\n        addRaw(b, a, -cost, 0);\n    }\n\n    bool spfa() {\n        for (int i = 1; i <= nodeCnt; ++i) {\n            used[i] = false;\n            dist[i] = INF;\n        }\n        int q[MAXP], qh = 0, qt = 0;\n        dist[src] = 0;\n        q[qt++] = src;\n        used[src] = true;\n        while (qh < qt) {\n            int x = q[qh++];\n            used[x] = false;\n            for (int e = head[x]; e; e = edges[e].nxt) {\n                if (!edges[e].cap) continue;\n                int y = edges[e].to;\n                if (dist[y] > dist[x] + edges[e].cost) {\n                    dist[y] = dist[x] + edges[e].cost;\n                    if (!used[y]) {\n                        used[y] = true;\n                        q[qt++] = y;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return dist[sink] < INF;\n    }\n\n    int augment(int x, int flow) {\n        if (x == src) return flow;\n        used[x] = true;\n        int rem = flow;\n        for (int e = head[x]; e; e = edges[e].nxt) {\n            int y = edges[e].to;\n            if (used[y] || !edges[e ^ 1].cap || dist[x] < dist[y] + edges[e ^ 1].cost) continue;\n            int got = augment(y, min(rem, edges[e ^ 1].cap));\n            if (got) {\n                rem -= got;\n                edges[e ^ 1].cap -= got;\n                edges[e].cap += got;\n                if (!rem) break;\n            }\n        }\n        return flow - rem;\n    }\n};\n\nMinCostMaxFlow mcmf;\n\nint n, m, k, c, d;\nint people[MAXN];\nint id[MAXN][MAXT];\nint answer;\n\nint main() {\n    scanf(\"%d%d%d%d%d\", &n, &m, &k, &c, &d);\n    for (int i = 1; i <= k; ++i) {\n        int x;\n        scanf(\"%d\", &x);\n        ++people[x];\n    }\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n        for (int j = 1; j <= k + m + 2; ++j) {\n            id[i][j] = ++mcmf.nodeCnt;\n            if (i == 1) mcmf.addEdge(id[i][j], mcmf.sink, c * (j - 1), INF);\n            if (j > 1) mcmf.addEdge(id[i][j - 1], id[i][j], 0, INF);\n        }\n        if (people[i]) mcmf.addEdge(mcmf.src, id[i][1], 0, people[i]);\n    }\n    for (int i = 1; i <= m; ++i) {\n        int a, b;\n        scanf(\"%d%d\", &a, &b);\n        for (int j = 1; j <= k + m + 1; ++j) {\n            for (int cost = 1; cost <= 2 * k - 1; cost += 2) {\n                mcmf.addEdge(id[a][j], id[b][j + 1], cost * d, 1);\n                mcmf.addEdge(id[b][j], id[a][j + 1], cost * d, 1);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    int sent = 0;\n    while (mcmf.spfa()) {\n        int add = -1;\n        while (add) {\n            memset(mcmf.used, 0, sizeof(mcmf.used));\n            add = mcmf.augment(mcmf.sink, INF);\n            sent += add;\n            answer += mcmf.dist[mcmf.sink] * add;\n        }\n    }\n    assert(sent == k);\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", answer);\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\nMAXN = 55\nMAXT = 2 * MAXN\nMAXP = MAXT * MAXN\nMAXE = 5 * MAXT * MAXN * MAXN\nINF = 1000000000\n\nclass Edge:\n    __slots__ = ('to', 'cap', 'cost', 'nxt')\n    def __init__(self, to=0, cap=0, cost=0, nxt=0):\n        self.to = to\n        self.cap = cap\n        self.cost = cost\n        self.nxt = nxt\n\nclass MinCostMaxFlow:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.ecnt = 1\n        self.src = 1\n        self.sink = 2\n        self.nodeCnt = 2\n        self.head = [0] * (MAXP + 1)\n        self.edges = [None] * (MAXE + 1)  # index 0 unused\n        self.used = [False] * (MAXP + 1)\n        self.dist = [0] * (MAXP + 1)\n\n    def addRaw(self, a, b, cost, cap):\n        self.ecnt += 1\n        e = self.ecnt\n        self.edges[e] = Edge(b, cap, cost, self.head[a])\n        self.head[a] = e\n\n    def addEdge(self, a, b, cost, cap):\n        self.addRaw(a, b, cost, cap)\n        self.addRaw(b, a, -cost, 0)\n\n    def spfa(self):\n        for i in range(1, self.nodeCnt + 1):\n            self.used[i] = False\n            self.dist[i] = INF\n        q = deque()\n        self.dist[self.src] = 0\n        q.append(self.src)\n        self.used[self.src] = True\n        while q:\n            x = q.popleft()\n            self.used[x] = False\n            e = self.head[x]\n            while e:\n                edge = self.edges[e]\n                if edge.cap:\n                    y = edge.to\n                    if self.dist[y] > self.dist[x] + edge.cost:\n                        self.dist[y] = self.dist[x] + edge.cost\n                        if not self.used[y]:\n                            self.used[y] = True\n                            q.append(y)\n                e = edge.nxt\n        return self.dist[self.sink] < INF\n\n    def augment(self, x, flow):\n        if x == self.src:\n            return flow\n        self.used[x] = True\n        rem = flow\n        e = self.head[x]\n        while e:\n            edge = self.edges[e]\n            y = edge.to\n            rev = self.edges[e ^ 1]\n            if not self.used[y] and rev.cap and self.dist[x] < self.dist[y] + rev.cost:\n                got = self.augment(y, min(rem, rev.cap))\n                if got:\n                    rem -= got\n                    rev.cap -= got\n                    edge.cap += got\n                    if not rem:\n                        break\n            e = edge.nxt\n        return flow - rem\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    it = iter(data)\n    n = int(next(it))\n    m = int(next(it))\n    k = int(next(it))\n    c = int(next(it))\n    d = int(next(it))\n\n    people = [0] * (n + 1)\n    for _ in range(k):\n        x = int(next(it))\n        people[x] += 1\n\n    mcmf = MinCostMaxFlow()\n    id_ = [[0] * (MAXT + 1) for _ in range(MAXN + 1)]\n\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        for j in range(1, k + m + 3):  # inclusive upper bound: k+m+2\n            mcmf.nodeCnt += 1\n            id_[i][j] = mcmf.nodeCnt\n            if i == 1:\n                mcmf.addEdge(id_[i][j], mcmf.sink, c * (j - 1), INF)\n            if j > 1:\n                mcmf.addEdge(id_[i][j - 1], id_[i][j], 0, INF)\n        if people[i]:\n            mcmf.addEdge(mcmf.src, id_[i][1], 0, people[i])\n\n    for _ in range(m):\n        a = int(next(it))\n        b = int(next(it))\n        for j in range(1, k + m + 2):  # j from 1 to k+m+1 inclusive\n            for cost in range(1, 2 * k, 2):  # cost = 1,3,5,...,2k-1\n                mcmf.addEdge(id_[a][j], id_[b][j + 1], cost * d, 1)\n                mcmf.addEdge(id_[b][j], id_[a][j + 1], cost * d, 1)\n\n    sent = 0\n    answer = 0\n    while mcmf.spfa():\n        add = -1\n        while add:\n            for i in range(1, mcmf.nodeCnt + 1):\n                mcmf.used[i] = False\n            add = mcmf.augment(mcmf.sink, INF)\n            sent += add\n            answer += mcmf.dist[mcmf.sink] * add\n\n    # assert sent == k\n    print(answer)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-3.8265450712060556e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0002967870968859643, -0.0002127659390680492, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.07890671491622925, -0.009890479035675526, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.00016711745411157608, -0.11696529388427734, -0.0005036516231484711, -1.9073468138230965e-06, 0.0, -4.172316494077677e-06, -9.179073458653875e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -0.0031808041967451572, -1.311301275563892e-06, -4.005352093372494e-05, -4.768370445162873e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0003808011533692479, -0.00015960850578267127, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.311301275563892e-06, -5.602820692729438e-06, -2.0146166207268834e-05, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -9.417489309271332e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0007545484695583582, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.576272320060525e-06, -0.002810340141877532, -9.536738616588991e-07, -1.19209